OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Ffine evening for all with plenty of
OL,7,Fevening sunshine to come. Then dry
OL,8,Fovernight with light to moderate
OL,9,Feasterly winds. Not quite as chilly as
OL,10,Frecent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FAnother dry and bright day
OL,13,Fwith lengthy sunny spells Light to
OL,14,Fmoderate easterly winds throughout,
OL,15,Fleading to a cooler feel around the
OL,16,Fcoasts, but turning increasingly humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
